<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-BRITISH LIONS TOUR ITINERARY.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-BRITISH LIONS TOUR ITINERARY.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Itinerary for 1997 British Lions</p>
<p>tour of South Africa:</p>
<p> May  24     v  E.Province Invitation XV   (Port Elizabeth)</p>
<p>	28     v  Border			   (East London)</p>
<p>	31     v  Western Province	     (Cape Town)</p>
<p> June  4     v  S.E Transvaal		  (Witbank)</p>
<p>	 7     v  Northern Transvaal	   (Pretoria)</p>
<p>	11     v  Transvaal			(Johannesburg)</p>
<p>	14     v  Natal			    (Durban)</p>
<p>	17     v  Emerging Springboks	  (Wellington)</p>
<p>	21     v  SOUTH AFRICA		   (Cape Town)</p>
<p>	24     v  Free State		     (Bloemfontein)</p>
<p>	28     v  SOUTH AFRICA		   (Durban)</p>
<p> July  1     v  Northern Free State	  (Welkom)</p>
<p>	 5     v  SOUTH AFRICA		   (Johannesburg)</p>
</text>
